<title>FINLAND: HK RUOKATALO 10-YEAR BOND ISSUE FULLY SUBSCRIBED.</title>
<headline>HK RUOKATALO 10-YEAR BOND ISSUE FULLY SUBSCRIBED.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish food group HK Ruokatalo Oy said in a statement on Friday its 62.5 million markka 10-year bond issue was fully subscribed.</p>
<p>The subscription period ended on Jan 30, 1997, and the bond will be fully repaid on Dec 30, 2006, it said.</p>
<p>HK Ruokatalo said it will seek bourse listing for the bond.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 240</p>
